Note: When assertions are enabled, any code that causes an assertion to fail will raise a `System.Diagnostics.AssertionException`. In the debug mode, this can be handled by the debugger or logged. In the release or test mode, the assertion failure will terminate the program, which can be convenient for testing and debugging.--------------------